                      Explore careers with KRE Security
                    </small>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-primary text-base font-bold flex-shrink-0" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:wa48er">&nearr;</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs text-dark-muted-foreground mt-4 text-center" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:onoj4g">
