                  [ Service Locations ]
                </span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-foreground mb-4 text-h3 leading-[1.2]" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:bl9jq4">
                Classes Offered In
              </h3>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:316z10">
