          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-6" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:pavuv3">
            <div class="tactical-frame border border-dark-border overflow-hidden" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:pavuv2">
              <img
                src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/fe6bcc20/images/39725c_6425aae246544e0892331fb709c801fb-mv2-320-8d2917-320.webp"
                alt="Group CPR and First Aid training"
                width="320"
                height="240"
                class="w-full max-w-[320px] h-auto object-cover"
                loading="lazy" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:5jg3f7" />
            </div>

            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-dark-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:onoj2y">
              Group CPR, First Aid, AED Training are conducted by our firm both in the field or in our educational teaching location.
            </p>

            <div class="border border-dark-border p-5 bg-secondary" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:pavuv1">
              <p class="text-xs font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3 text-primary" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:onoj2x">
                [ Contact Our Training Division ]
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-2" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:pavuv0">
                <div data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:pavuuz">
                  <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-dark-muted-foreground mb-1" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:onoj2w">
                    Reading / Eastern PA
                  </p>
                  <a href="tel:6105620971" class="font-display font-bold text-dark-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors">
                    610-562-0971
                  </a>
                </div>
                <div data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:pavuuy">
                  <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-dark-muted-foreground mb-1" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:onoj2v">
                    Allentown / Bethlehem
                  </p>
                  <a href="tel:4843343577" class="font-display font-bold text-dark-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors" data-ps="src/pages/first-aid-training.astro:o8zb2c">
                    484-334-3577
                  </a>
